Core campaign advancement procedure and reusable Drive-set standard

Status: Canon core procedure; source Drive libraries and detailed Drive-writing guidance remain in development.

Purpose: Define how campaigns select Drives, how players earn Drive Marks, how those Marks become character points, and what reusable GATES sources must provide.

Scope: General GATES campaigns, with an explicitly optional Isekai Prestige module. Caliber and Drive internalization are not part of the forward core framework.
